# PHOENIX PORTAL LINKS [MUST]

## Rule PORTAL.0: Dev 1 preview URLs

When a chat reply, report, or test summary includes a clickable Phoenix portal link for **Dev 1**, use this base:

`https://devapps.energo-pro.bg/app/phoenix1-dev`

Paths come from `Cursor-Project/Phoenix/phoenix-ui/src/app` routing. Use these shapes:

| Entity | Path |
|---|---|
| Customer | `/customers/preview/basic?id={id}` |
| Compensation | `/compensation/preview?id={id}` |
| Invoice | `/invoices/preview/basic-data?id={id}` |
| Billing run | `/billing-run/preview/basic-parameters?id={id}&type={BILLING_TYPE}` |
| Invoice correction billing run | `/billing-run/preview/basic-parameters?id={id}&type=INVOICE_CORRECTION` |
| Customer receivable | `/customer-receivables/preview?id={id}` |
| Customer liability | `/customer-liabilities/preview?id={id}` |
| Product contract | `/energy-product-contracts/preview/basic-parameters?id={id}` |
| Point of delivery | `/points-of-delivery/preview?id={id}` |

## Forbidden in user-facing links

- `/government-compensations/preview` — the UI route is `/compensation/preview`. The API path `/government-compensations` is not a portal page.
- `/billing-run/invoices/preview/basic-parameters` — invoice tabs are `basic-data`, `summary-data`, `detailed-data`.
- `/invoices/preview/basic-parameters` — same reason.

Billing-run tabs do use `basic-parameters`. Do not copy that segment onto invoice URLs.

## Rule PORTAL.1: Billing run `type` is required

The billing-run preview reads `type` from the query string. If `type` is missing, the page replaces the URL with `type=STANDARD_BILLING` (`phoenix-ui` `create-or-edit.component.ts`, `checkDetailedDataLoad`). A correction run opened without `type` shows the standard billing screen.

Every user-facing billing-run link MUST include `type` set to that run's billing type. For an invoice correction run the value is exactly `INVOICE_CORRECTION`.

Known type values (`BillingTypeIds` in `phoenix-ui/.../billing-run-consts.ts`):

| Run | `type` |
|---|---|
| Standard billing | `STANDARD_BILLING` |
| Invoice correction | `INVOICE_CORRECTION` |
| Invoice reversal | `INVOICE_REVERSAL` |
| Manual invoice | `MANUAL_INVOICE` |
| Manual credit or debit note | `MANUAL_CREDIT_OR_DEBIT_NOTE` |
| Manual interim and advance | `MANUAL_INTERIM_AND_ADVANCE_PAYMENT` |

Do not emit `/billing-run/preview/basic-parameters?id={id}` with no `type`.

If a test log prints both a route and a second rewritten URL, prefer the path in the table above and still append the real `type`.

Violation is a **MUST** when a user-facing Dev 1 link uses a path that is not in this table.
